stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Proposed B3 workspace cycle state machine
  accDescr: The cycle moves from collection to validation, coalition formation, competition, admission, broadcast, consumption, outcome recording, policy update, and expiry. Invalid candidates are rejected before competition. A cycle with no eligible coalition follows a no-admission path. Delivery failure is recorded without changing the selected snapshot. Late candidates and late outcomes cannot rewrite an expired cycle.
  [*] --> COLLECTING
  COLLECTING --> VALIDATING : cycle deadline or collection complete
  VALIDATING --> COALITION_FORMATION : eligible candidates remain
  VALIDATING --> NO_ADMISSION : no eligible candidates
  COALITION_FORMATION --> COMPETING
  COMPETING --> ADMITTED : winner fits hard budget
  COMPETING --> NO_ADMISSION : no eligible coalition
  ADMITTED --> BROADCAST
  BROADCAST --> CONSUMING : at least one delivery succeeds
  BROADCAST --> DELIVERY_FAILURE : all deliveries fail
  DELIVERY_FAILURE --> OUTCOME_RECORDED : record failed delivery
  CONSUMING --> OUTCOME_RECORDED : consumers finish or deadline
  OUTCOME_RECORDED --> POLICY_UPDATE : feedback batch eligible
  OUTCOME_RECORDED --> EXPIRED : no update in this window
  POLICY_UPDATE --> EXPIRED
  NO_ADMISSION --> EXPIRED
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  note right of ADMITTED
    Snapshot is immutable
    and versioned.
  end note
  note right of EXPIRED
    Workspace content expires;
    audit and outcome records persist.
  end note
